erty.\" \"Their story spans a century, from John's birth in 1736, through the Revolution, to Moses' death in 1836. The brothers were partners in business and politics and in founding the university that bears their name. They joined in the struggle against England, attending secret sessions of the Sons of Liberty and, in John's case, leading a midnight pirate raid against a British revenue cutter. But for the Browns as for the nation, the institution of slavery was the one question that admitted no middle ground.","displaySummary":"The brothers were partners in business and politics and in founding the university that bears their name. They joined in the struggle against England, attending secret sessions of the Sons of Liberty and, in John's case, leading a midnight pirate raid against a British revenue cutter. But for the Browns as for the nation, the institution of slavery was the one question that admitted no middle ground.","primarySubject":"Biography","primaryTopic":"Oceans, Rivers & Water","subjectEvidence":{"primarySubject":"Biography","confidence":"medium","method":"evidence_score","candidates":[{"subject":"Biography","score":12,"evidenceCount":2},{"subject":"History","score":6,"evidenceCount":2}],"evidence":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"Biography","mappedSubject":"Biography","score":6,"confidence":"high","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-sons-of-providence-the-brown-brothers-the-slave-trade-and-the-american-revolution-charles-rapple","id":"subject-evidence-book-sons-of-providence-the-brown-brothers-the-slave-trade-and-the-american-revolution-charles-rapple-2"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"United states, history, colonial period, ca. 1600-1775, biography","mappedSubject":"Biography","score":6,"confidence":"high","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-sons-of-providence-the-brown-brothers-the-slave-trade-and-the-american-revolution-charles-rapple","id":"subject-evidence-bo